WEBVTT

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:49.940
If I had run away from home over something simple like puberty, I'd be happy...

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:52.680
Huh?

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:57.130
I never want to go home!

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:03.200
So they need you to replace me!

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:08.440
Yuzuyu, I...

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.580
...want to die.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:31.880
Die?

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:36.860
Um... To die is...

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:39.620
Well, like your dad...

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:40.390
Papa?

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:46.480
Actually, nevermind.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:49.010
Keep this a secret.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.830
Oh, Miki. Your uniform looks good.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.100
Do your best!

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:10.910
Okay!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:12.770
Do your best!

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:13.670
Okay!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.310
But I'm sorry. I am being selfish.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.480
You are apologizing due to school expenses?

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:22.350
If that's all, don't worry about it.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:23.520
We'll get by somehow.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:24.760
That's right.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:28.030
If you really want to go to that school so badly...

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.290
...we'll just have to make do.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:30.490
Thanks!

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:31.780
I'll do my best!

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:36.130
I'll study hard and make a lot of friends!

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:38.860
Hey, Hey! Wanting to make lots of friends is like...

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.130
...An elementary school student!

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.540
Hey, hey! Wake Up!

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.080
You're awake?

00:03:57.530 --> 00:03:58.460
What're you doing?

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:00.010
Coming in here like that...

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.690
Shut up!

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:04.860
You already came into my room like this!

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:06.400
Don't hold a grudge...

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:07.490
I do!

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:08.950
What's with that?

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.500
Your sleeping face...

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:23.580
...is much more cheeky than when you're awake.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.580
Well Sorry about that!

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:36.420
It's shaking...

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.530
It's shaking...

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:47.700
Here! Water!

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:49.430
It's yummy!

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.330
Wait.

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:55.450
What's this?

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.280
Why're you giving them to me?

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:02.580
It's common sense to help out around the house during summer vacation.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.420
Did you think we'd just let you freeload around here?

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:06.650
Got it?

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:08.430
Are you serious?

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.390
Look! Learn from Yuzuyu-chan!

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:16.660
Although she sometimes pulls out flowers, too..

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:19.010
Okay. Get to work!

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:20.800
If you slack off, no food for you.

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.090
I'm gonna go clean the tub.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:49.980
What a pain.

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:54.340
Miki-chan!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.510
Are you finished cleaning up outside?

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:57.400
Yuzuyu...

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.000
I haven't done this in ages.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.540
You sure get along well here.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:04.730
I like helping out!

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:08.510
So, where do i toss this out?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.010
Umm...

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:17.560
You actually did it well.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:18.770
What do you mean by that?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.490
Are you being a good girl?

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:22.270
I'll hit you.

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:25.930
A cat!

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.240
Good cat, good cat.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:35.780
Good girl, good girl.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.380
Cut that out!

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:44.850
Bye bye!

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.940
Where'd you put it?

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.530
You didn't throw it out, right?

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:56.060
I really like it, so if you threw it out, I'll...

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:56.790
Hey, hey!

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:58.490
What's next?

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:01.710
Next, we're going on an errand!

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:02.950
Yay! An errand!

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:04.670
An errand!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.600
You're coming, too, of course.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.210
Don't change the topic.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:10.010
I didn't throw it out.

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:11.780
It's in safekeeping.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.550
Anyway, let's go!

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.870
An errand! An errand!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.600
I don't want to go.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.240
Errands are so...

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.350
You've never gone on one, right?

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.590
Moreover, I still haven't even gotten dressed!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:29.490
Even so...

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:36.820
How did this happen?

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.770
Stop grumbling.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.310
Give me the basket.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:46.110
Okay, children, you can pick your candies!

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.150
Upto 200 yen, that is.

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:49.950
Yay!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:50.740
What?

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.510
I'm gonna go get the meat.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.110
Hey!

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.520
Mikan-chan, hurry up!

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:10.180
I want one that comes with a toy.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.730
Candies...

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.390
But this is how I was when I was little.

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:25.220
Kippei-oniichan... always buys me candies.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:32.880
Hey!

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:34.210
Have you decided?

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:36.100
Not yet!

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:40.800
I feel like he's taken away my spirits.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.830
What'd you say?

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.150
Nothing.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:52.220
You want two pieces of gum?

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:54.460
Well, it's okay...

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.200
Choose something dreamier!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.150
Like redone Ozaki caramels!

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:00.620
Then...

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:05.000
Not that many!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:07.510
I said up to 200 yen!

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:13.210
Well, I'm gonna go pay.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.300
I want this!

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:38.130
Tarou-chan! Let's go over there.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:44.860
Miki!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.230
Hurry up and come here.

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.550
It's hot...

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.960
Can I have some juice when we get back?

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:13.730
Sure.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.960
It sure is hot...

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:28.680
Hey, you.

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:30.440
Me?

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:37.550
Don't you think baby-sitting and doing house stuff is uncool?

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.150
I never really thought about it.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:41.950
Is it uncool?

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:45.650
There's nothing wrong with it.

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:05.510
Come to think of it, have you been contacted by your parents since then?

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:07.460
I haven't.

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:09.080
Really?

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:11.280
That was just at first.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.710
In reality, no one cares about me.

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:24.770
Even though you're a pretty good girl...

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.560
Don't give me some strange pity of yours.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:31.650
Hey...

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:32.600
What?

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.270
Let's line up and walk.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.650
Is it uncool?

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:42.610
Not really.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.220
Then...

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:42.050
Huh?

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:44.550
Are you going out, Kippei-onii-chan?

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:45.340
Yeah...

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.530
Today's a school day.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.360
I'll be right back...

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.410
See ya!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:53.750
Then I'll go out, too!

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.180
I don't need my bag.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:04.150
Hey!

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:11.480
Is school fun?

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.140
Yeah, it's fun.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.700
Hey. Don't peek into my room!

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:18.480
It's scary.

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:23.310
Did i hurt your feelings?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.320
Take me with you.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:28.320
What?

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:31.300
Teach me what's fun about school.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.420
What?!

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:35.460
Yuzuyu-chan, be a good girl.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:36.690
Okay!

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:41.670
Hey!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:42.900
See ya!

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:43.630
Wait!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.240
Hey, Kippei! ...And Miki!

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.680
That's dangerous!

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.130
No fair!

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:52.160
They left me behind!

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.780
Yuzuyu-chan, don't grow up to be like them.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.350
People will hate you.

00:13:58.880 --> 00:13:59.960
Okay!

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:15.720
Bye bye!

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:17.120
Let's play again!

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:20.830
What is it, Katakura?

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.020
Coming in at this time....

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:26.060
Sensei, listen to me...

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.070
I was being chased by some weirdo, and losing them was really tough!

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:35.060
I even took two laps around the Yamanote line, and by the time I realized it, school was over!

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:36.260
School tears!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.280
And so...?

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.310
Please add me to the attendance list!

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:42.600
Grow up a little!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.570
I'm not gonna lose.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:08.860
Are you stupid?

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:11.990
I'm through with you.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:13.300
See ya.

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:30.050
Don't wear your pants on your hips!

00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:30.530
Okay

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.310
It's Kippei.

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.030
He upset the teacher.

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:36.990
What? Did you just get here?

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.300
Why even show up?

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:39.640
What was that?

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.360
I did my best to get here!

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:42.390
Huh?

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:43.810
Where's Kokoro-chan?

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:44.320
Oh, yeah...

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:45.460
She is in the school infirmary.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:46.390
Yeah.

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:53.200
Geez.Where'd he go?

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:57.070
Well, there's no way he'd escape from me.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:07.950
Kokoro-chan...?

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:09.460
You're awake...

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:11.880
Hey, hey! Are you okay?

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.770
I heard you had a fever.

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.240
Yeah... I caught a summer cold.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.740
I caught a summer cold.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.160
I guess I am stupid.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.160
You're stupid?

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:21.940
No Way!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.430
Then what am I?

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:27.290
If you're not feeling well, you should rest at home.

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:30.180
I am fine. Go away.

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:31.320
You are making me feel worse!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:33.470
Why now?

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:35.200
Where do you feel bad?

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.200
'Cause...

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:41.380
...it's been a long time.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.100
You said you'd call...

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.110
S-Sorry...

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.760
A lot has happened...

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:02.100
I'm sorry.

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:09.510
Can we kiss?

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:01.340
I wanted to try hurting someone once...

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.390
Yeah... Me, too.

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:06.480
Hey, Sakashita... Why don't you try dying?

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:50.460
Miki-chan! Welcome back!

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:52.700
Where's Kippei-onii-chan?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.000
Miki-chan...

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:44.320
This isn't where I belong.

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:51.280
Miki-chan... you shouldn't mess up the room.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:54.970
Yuzuyu, I'm going out.

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:56.470
Come with me.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:04.100
But, Auntie is out shopping, so I have to look after the house.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:06.880
I'll take you to your mama.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:07.960
Mama!

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.020
I'm the only one who knows where she is.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.100
Let's go Yuzuyu.

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:18.430
We're gonna go see Mama?

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:19.170
Yep.

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:22.940
I'll... go.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:33.760
I thought I could live with just a little bit of happiness...

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:39.570
Though, with a little despair, I've begun to think I've falled into depths of darkness.

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:45.000
I've already... come this far...

00:23:51.970 --> 00:23:52.810
Miki-chan?

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:20.910
Hey!

00:24:21.140 --> 00:24:22.340
Yuzuyu!

00:24:22.850 --> 00:24:23.890
Miki!

00:24:24.150 --> 00:24:25.630
Where'd you go?

00:24:25.920 --> 00:24:27.400
Where's my mama?

00:24:27.780 --> 00:24:29.810
Miki-chan, are you crying?

00:24:30.090 --> 00:24:31.810
Did something sad happen?

00:24:32.050 --> 00:24:33.910
Miki, what're you doing?

00:24:34.420 --> 00:24:35.450
That's dangerous.

00:24:35.550 --> 00:24:36.390
Don't move!

00:24:36.660 --> 00:24:37.510
Stop!

00:24:38.690 --> 00:24:40.490
Next time on Aishiteru ze Baby:

00:24:40.920 --> 00:24:42.400
Let's Go Home!

00:24:43.440 --> 00:24:46.590
Even though I really want to be with Kippei-onii-chan!
